DETAIL:  The statement would drop trigger pg_repack_safe_rewrites_writer_only on table pg_repack_safe_rewrites. A snapshot taken before a recorded REPACK (CONCURRENTLY), on this server or on any standby, would then read the rewritten table as empty.
